## Summary

Successfully expanded Risk and Finding entities with full correlation linkage as specified in the data model. The correlation engine now has the complete data model to connect technical findings to executive narratives.

### Risk Entity Expansion
Added correlation fields to link risks to:
- Business processes (businessProcessId[])
- Data objects (dataObjectIds[])
- Threat scenarios (threatScenarioId)
- Framework mappings (frameworkMappings[])
- Financial exposure (financialExposure, costToRemediate)
- Legal obligations (legalObligationId[])
- Owners (executiveOwner, remediationOwner, evidenceOwner)
- Audit evidence (auditEvidenceRequired, auditTestIds[])

### Finding Entity Expansion
Added correlation fields to link findings to:
- Risk ID (riskId)
- Asset ID (assetId)
- Application ID (applicationId)
- Business process ID (businessProcessId)
- Repeat detection (isRepeat, originalFindingId, repeatCount)

