## Next Steps

T-011 is complete. Proceed to T-012: Build the correlation engine logic.

T-012 will implement the service layer that:
1. Takes a technical finding as input
2. Correlates it with business processes, data objects, threat scenarios
3. Calculates financial exposure
4. Maps to frameworks and legal obligations
5. Returns the executive narrative with owners and audit evidence requirements
